        1910,
        2008
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "In accordance with Section 117b (2) of the New York City Charter itemized information in the aforementioned supporting schedules of the Mayor's Message have included modifications to March 15th. Subsequent actions, in accordance with the provisions of the New York City Charter approving modifications are hereby carried over effective July 1st. Further actions in addition to provisions of the New York City Charter approving modifications have been made which adjusted the rates of positions reallocated as of January 1, 1964, are to be incorporated in the aforementioned supporting schedules, effective July 1st.",
